{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n香港限定黑芝麻麻糬+芒果糯米飯\n</p>\n<h2>泰奶界天花板登陸啟德Airside！</h2>\n<p>被譽為「泰奶界Hermes」、泰國精品泰奶品牌Karun Thai Tea正式衝出泰國，於啟德Airside開設全港首間旗艦店！Karun堅持嚴選泰國三大茶區的頂級紅茶，結合家傳秘製茶葉配方，茶香濃郁順滑、醇厚回甘且絕不帶澀，徹底顛覆傳統街頭泰奶過於甜膩的刻板印象。除了傳統泰奶，更驚喜推出香港獨家限定泰式奶茶與 AIRSIDE 獨家泰茶烘焙系列，香港泰茶愛好者排爆！</p>\n<h2>兩款香港限定泰式奶茶！</h2>\n<p>Karun特別推出兩款香港限定泰式奶茶，分別是黑芝麻麻糬泰式奶茶及豆腐布甸泰式奶茶，前者將香港傳統口味黑芝麻的濃郁堅果香，融入 Karun 醇厚泰奶中，加入Q彈黑芝麻麻糬，融合港式風味；後者頂層加入豆乳奶蓋，並配上泰國特色傳統小食油炸鬼及滑嫩豆腐布甸，既保留泰茶的醇厚，又增添柔滑的布甸層次，輕盈得來又好飲！</p>\n<h2>最具特色芒果糯米飯泰式奶茶！</h2>\n<p>最具泰國甜點風情的一定是將芒果糯米飯泰式奶茶，香甜芒果與軟糯米香，襯托出紅茶的濃郁回甘；靈感源自曼谷街頭人氣小吃的糖絲捲餅泰式奶茶，口感層次豐富，甜香與茶香完美平衡！記得要試埋AIRSIDE限定多款泰茶烘焙系列，包括泰奶麻糬撻、椰泡泰奶布甸、焦糖泰奶吉士牛角包、泰奶忌廉牛角包，啱哂一眾甜品控！</p>\n<p>Karun Thai Tea<br/>\n地址：九龍城協調道2號啟德AIRSIDE 2樓 220號舖<br/>\n營業時間: 星期一至星期五 11:30 – 22:00，星期六、日及公眾假期 11:00 – 22:00<br/>\n官方IG：@karunthaitea_hk/</p>\n<p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550004307276964_10021812616b05280b8d8cc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550004307276964_10021812616b05280b8d8cc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550004480566416_7755540926b05280d40745.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550004480566416_7755540926b05280d40745.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550004674825047_6828743146b05280f37e84.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550004674825047_6828743146b05280f37e84.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550004847819682_8576224266b052810d34c7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550004847819682_8576224266b052810d34c7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550005016214828_10732354006b052812c9dcf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550005016214828_10732354006b052812c9dcf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550005228174902_15052446726b052814baca0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550005228174902_15052446726b052814baca0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550005436985654_14764338286b052816c1876.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550005436985654_14764338286b052816c1876.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550005645872501_470118346b052818d29c7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550005645872501_470118346b052818d29c7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550005821837876_21470371306b05281aac1c6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550005821837876_21470371306b05281aac1c6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgHDBVWgY8g/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:23:54.825925+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":926,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T06:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T06:17:19.878289+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:17:19.878289+00:00","content_hash":"bfe13ce249304b25aac5f239986f35443bab1245476e44ca159c345ddf13b6dc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}